      ],
      "dependsOn": [],
      "justification": "Timer lifecycle states Idle, Running, Paused and the transitions Start, Pause, Resume and Stop (from Running) that the legacy timer rules state and DF-CHRONA-2026-0002 makes part of the requirements. Held time (CHX-104, DF-CHRONA-2026-0005) and Stop from Paused are not decided here."
    },
